    <string name="privacy_body">MuMuslim anoremekedza kuvanzika kwako uye haatore data rako.\n\n• Hapana chekutevera: hapana ad SDKs, analytics kana kushambadzira trackers.\n• Dhata inoramba iri pamudziyo wako: data rako rese (nzvimbo, marongero, mabhukumaki) anochengetwa munharaunda pamudziyo wako chete.\n• Nzvimbo inoshandiswa munharaunda: makongiresi ako anoshandiswa kuverenga nguva dzemunamato uye qibla pachishandiso chako, uye haambotumirwa kune chero kunze server.\n• Mvumo chete pazvinenge zvichidiwa: tinokumbira mvumo (nzvimbo, zviziviso) chete kana chimwe chinhu chichinyatsozvida, netsananguro yakajeka.\n• Hapana kumanikidzwa kubatana: iyo app inoshanda isina Indaneti; kushandiswa kwenetiweki kunosarudzika kune zvekuwedzera sekudhawunirodha kudzokorora.\n\nIyi mutemo chikamu cheyakavhurika-sosi repository uye yakavhurika kuongororwa kwenharaunda.</string>
